L000441	{\color{Blue4}\textit{Magnetization-independent behavior of $C^{\perp}(\mathbf{q})$.---}}
L000442	Figure~\ref{fig:em_order_profile} shows that the $|C|=1$ Landau-level state at $m=2/3$ exhibits $120^\circ$ correlations with $K$-point peaks in $C^{\perp}(\mathbf{q})$, consistent with the $|C|=1$ state at $m=1/3$ shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:order_profile}(d,e).
L000443	Thus, the dominant transverse correlations for $|C|=1$ are insensitive to magnetization.
